VectorCraft is an open source vector illustration application, a
clean-room reimplementation of the Adobe Illustrator workflow written in
pure Rust by the ArtCraft team.  It has pen, shape and brush tools,
artboards, type, gradients, swatches, layers, clipping masks, Pathfinder
operations, Smart Guides and live effects through the Appearance panel,
and opens and saves SVG and PDF.

The vectorcraft-cli tool runs the same engine commands from scripts for
headless conversion and batch work, and serves them over MCP for agents.
